# Both api/Dockerfile and web/Dockerfile build with the repo ROOT as their
# context (docker-compose.yml: `context: .`) and `COPY api ./api` /
# `COPY web ./web` run AFTER `yarn install --frozen-lockfile`. Without this
# file, a host node_modules tree (present on any machine that has already
# run `yarn install` locally) gets copied straight over the freshly
# installed one inside the image — silently replacing the image's Linux
# native binaries and correct hoisting with whatever happens to be on the
# host. See design/2026-08-20-agent-wolf.md § W1 acceptance criteria
# (agent-bob repo).
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
dist
**/dist
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
coverage
**/coverage
